EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

We want to evaluate your application for a New American University Scholarship (https://students.asu.edu/scholarships/newamericanuniversity), but we need you to submit your official ACT or SAT score.

With your current GPA and a test score on file, you may be eligible for one of our merit-based scholarships ranging from $2,000 to $10,000 per year for Arizona residents ($3,000 to $14,000 for nonresidents).

Students with an ACT or SAT score on file are automatically considered for the scholarship upon admission. Please have an official copy of your test scores sent directly from the testing source.

If you have any questions about this scholarship opportunity, the enrollment process or ASU in general, please don't hesitate to contact me.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
